OL,3,GNEWSAWar silhouettes mark Remembrance
OL,4,Acommemorations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art installation featuring
OL,7,Fwartime-themed silhouettes has been
OL,8,Funveiled in Grantham as part of the
OL,9,Ftown's Remembrance commemorations.
OL,11,FThe display outside the Guildhall Arts
OL,12,FCentre includes wooden figures
OL,13,Frepresenting a World War One Tommy, a
OL,14,FWorld War Two paratrooper, a Land Girl
OL,15,Fand a member of the Women's Royal Naval
OL,16,FService (Wrens).
OL,18,FA cascading display of poppies has also
OL,19,Fbeen installed as a tribute to those
OL,20,Fwho served.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
