OL,3,GNEWSAWar silhouettes mark Remembrance
OL,4,Acommemorations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will also be a military march in
OL,7,Fthe town on 8 November, following a
OL,8,FRemembrance Sunday service at St
OL,9,FWulfram's Church.
